     <td><para unique="1092667">IM</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1092669">V/N.E.</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1092671">USER_MSR</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1092673">	Write the value of register bbb to the MSR specified in the 32-bit immediate. </para>
